§§ `The table of rates for reduced sight`

-- The printed table is symmetric about its diagonal (the two axes carry the same ten levels). A
-- transcription slip in one cell would break that, so this is a check on the transcription that
-- does not come from it.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN i YIELD all (GIVEN j YIELD at (at `the table of rates for reduced sight` i) j EQUALS at (at `the table of rates for reduced sight` j) i) (range 0 9)) (range 0 9)
